---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Experience – Hanh Tran"
  description="Work experience of Hanh Tran: Arkhn, Tihado, PhD research, 3T JSC and Samsung SDS."
  current="experience"
  footer="compact"
>
<main style="max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; box-sizing: border-box">

<section style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; padding: 40px 0 40px">
<h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.2vw, 3.2rem); line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: -0.035em; font-weight: 600">Experience</h1>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--body); max-width: 32em; text-wrap: pretty">Five years shipping AI in health, finance and legal, from research pipelines to systems that hospital and bank teams use every day.</p>
</section>

<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-top: 1px solid var(--ink)">

<article style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 28px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<div style="flex: 0 0 170px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); padding-top: 6px">
<div>2024 – Present</div>
<div>Paris, France</div>
</div>
<div style="flex: 999 1 420px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em">NLP Research Engineer</h2>
<div style="color: var(--muted)"><a href="https://www.arkhn.com/" style="color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500">Arkhn ↗</a> · health-tech scale-up</div>
</div>
<ul style="margin: 0; padding: 0 0 0 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; color: var(--body)">
<li style="text-wrap: pretty">Designed and deployed an agentic assistant that queries patient data in natural language and drafts clinical reports; selected in France’s 2025 public-sector AI call.</li>
<li style="text-wrap: pretty">Built OCR, parsing and extraction pipelines, with real-time tracing and automated LLM evaluation.</li>
<li style="text-wrap: pretty">Worked with clinical and IT teams at 19 of France’s 32 university hospitals to scope, deploy and troubleshoot AI workflows for users with no AI background.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</article>

<article style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 28px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<div style="flex: 0 0 170px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); padding-top: 6px">
