<div style="color: var(--muted)"><a href="https://tihado.com" style="color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500">Tihado ↗</a> · AI product studio</div>
</div>
<p style="margin: 0; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty">With a team of four, took five award-winning prototypes from idea to working demo in days, building with Codex and Claude Code.</p>
<ul style="margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 16px; color: var(--body)">
<li><strong style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">Pozify</strong> · 1st place, Gradio Build Small Hackathon · Jul 2026</li>
<li><strong style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">Posey</strong> · 1st place, WELTARE Spring Sprint · Apr 2026</li>
