<li><strong style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">EatAble</strong> · 3rd place, AMD Open Robotics Hackathon · Dec 2025</li>
</ul>
<a href="/" style="font-weight: 500; padding: 10px 0; align-self: flex-start">See the projects →</a>
</div>
