</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px">
<div style="font-weight: 600">ML and NLP</div>
<div style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted)">PyTorch, Hugging Face Transformers, spaCy, scikit-learn, PySpark</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px">
<div style="font-weight: 600">Software</div>
<div style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted)">Python, FastAPI, SQL, Docker, CI/CD, ArgoCD, GCP (Associate Cloud Engineer, 2025)</div>
</div>
</div>
